# Local editor / dev-server scaffolding.
.claude/
# Runtime logs. `logs/treasury-errors.log` was tracked, so every run — dev or
# deploy — produced a large spurious diff and a merge conflict waiting to
# happen, and stack traces went into the repo along with it. settings.py
# creates the directory itself (os.makedirs on _LOG_DIR), so nothing needs the
# folder to be in version control.
logs/
